  "timing_origin": "Newly authored 3.47-second fifteen-key one-shot interpretation of exact EXP-164 v002 static panels, not recovered motion. The catalogue 1.90-second schedule is an unimplemented reference proposal. Selected exact-vector compression of the reviewed 3.90-second proposal preserves every accepted source pose and all six deliberate holds; first sink .70 seconds versus .20-second effortful reopen.",
  "scope": "One shared separate-object rig on main958eb944, preserving all ten approved profiles and all runtime/art/gaze/brow/blink controls. Only ordinary lids, existing rigid brows and modest sealed mouth_purse are authored. No eye widening, smiling lids, mouth opening/smile/press, head/body/gaze/hair/FX acting or new capability. EXP-164 downturn is not EXP-153 compression.",
  "interpolation": "Unchanged generic cubic smoothstep, 0.30-second restart from displayed pose and 0.45-second generic release. Zero tangents remain at KP2 and KP8; compression shortens their unheld lingering without eliminating those joins. Actual-frame A/B review found no new contour jump, with faster local steps explicitly accepted as an authored tradeoff. No normal-speed playback observation.",
